{"id":93,"name":"Ad-Duhaa","nameAr":"الضحى","nameFr":"Le jour montant","place":"makkah","verses":[{"n":1,"k":"93:1","fr":"Par le Jour Montant !","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/093001.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَٱلضُّحَىٰ","en":"By the morning brightness","tr":"wal-ḍuḥā","l":"ضُحًى","r":"ضحو","p":"nom","a":"wbw/093_001_001.mp3"}]},{"n":2,"k":"93:2","fr":"Et par la nuit quand elle couvre tout !","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/093002.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَٱلَّيْلِ","en":"And the night","tr":"wa-al-layli","l":"لَيْل","r":"ليل","p":"nom","a":"wbw/093_002_001.mp3"},{"t":"إِذَا","en":"when","tr":"idhā","l":"إِذا","r":null,"p":"temps","a":"wbw/093_002_002.mp3"},{"t":"سَجَىٰ","en":"it covers with darkness","tr":"sajā","l":"سَجَى","r":"سجو","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/093_002_003.mp3"}]},{"n":3,"k":"93:3","fr":"Ton Seigneur ne t’a ni abandonné, ni détesté.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/093003.mp3","w":[{"t":"مَا","en":"Not","tr":"mā","l":"ما","r":null,"p":"négation","a":"wbw/093_003_001.mp3"},{"t":"وَدَّعَكَ","en":"has forsaken you","tr":"waddaʿaka","l":"وَدَّعَ","r":"ودع","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/093_003_002.mp3"},{"t":"رَبُّكَ","en":"your Lord","tr":"rabbuka","l":"رَبّ","r":"ربب","p":"nom","a":"wbw/093_003_003.mp3"},{"t":"وَمَا","en":"and not","tr":"wamā","l":"ما","r":null,"p":"négation","a":"wbw/093_003_004.mp3"},{"t":"قَلَىٰ","en":"He is displeased","tr":"qalā","l":"قَلَى","r":"قلي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/093_003_005.mp3"}]},{"n":4,"k":"93:4","fr":"La vie dernière t’est, certes, meilleure que la vie présente.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/093004.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَلَلْـَٔاخِرَةُ","en":"And surely the Hereafter","tr":"walalākhiratu","l":"آخِر","r":"أخر","p":"nom","a":"wbw/093_004_001.mp3"},{"t":"خَيْرٌۭ","en":"(is) better","tr":"khayrun","l":"خَيْر","r":"خير","p":"nom","a":"wbw/093_004_002.mp3"},{"t":"لَّكَ","en":"for you","tr":"laka","l":"لَّكَ","r":null,"p":"pronom","a":"wbw/093_004_003.mp3"},{"t":"مِنَ","en":"than","tr":"mina","l":"مِن","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/093_004_004.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلْأُولَىٰ","en":"the first","tr":"l-ūlā","l":"أَوَّل","r":"أول","p":"nom","a":"wbw/093_004_005.mp3"}]},{"n":5,"k":"93:5","fr":"Ton Seigneur t’accordera certes [Ses faveurs], et alors tu seras satisfait.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/093005.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَلَسَوْفَ","en":"And soon","tr":"walasawfa","l":"سَوْف","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/093_005_001.mp3"},{"t":"يُعْطِيكَ","en":"will give you","tr":"yuʿ'ṭīka","l":"أَعْطَى","r":"عطو","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/093_005_002.mp3"},{"t":"رَبُّكَ","en":"your Lord","tr":"rabbuka","l":"رَبّ","r":"ربب","p":"nom","a":"wbw/093_005_003.mp3"},{"t":"فَتَرْضَىٰٓ","en":"then you will be satisfied","tr":"fatarḍā","l":"رَضِيَ","r":"رضو","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/093_005_004.mp3"}]},{"n":6,"k":"93:6","fr":"Ne t’a-t-Il pas trouvé orphelin ? Alors Il t’a accueilli !","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/093006.mp3","w":[{"t":"أَلَمْ","en":"Did not","tr":"alam","l":"لَم","r":null,"p":"négation","a":"wbw/093_006_001.mp3"},{"t":"يَجِدْكَ","en":"He find you","tr":"yajid'ka","l":"وَجَدَ","r":"وجد","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/093_006_002.mp3"},{"t":"يَتِيمًۭا","en":"an orphan","tr":"yatīman","l":"يَتِيم","r":"يتم","p":"particule","a":"wbw/093_006_003.mp3"},{"t":"فَـَٔاوَىٰ","en":"and give shelter","tr":"faāwā","l":"آوَى","r":"أوي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/093_006_004.mp3"}]},{"n":7,"k":"93:7","fr":"Ne t’a-t-Il pas trouvé égaré ? Alors Il t’a guidé.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/093007.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَوَجَدَكَ","en":"And He found you","tr":"wawajadaka","l":"وَجَدَ","r":"وجد","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/093_007_001.mp3"},{"t":"ضَآلًّۭا","en":"lost","tr":"ḍāllan","l":"ضالّ","r":"ضلل","p":"particule","a":"wbw/093_007_002.mp3"},{"t":"فَهَدَىٰ","en":"so He guided","tr":"fahadā","l":"هَدَى","r":"هدي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/093_007_003.mp3"}]},{"n":8,"k":"93:8","fr":"Ne t’a-t-Il pas trouvé pauvre ? Alors Il t’a enrichi.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/093008.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَوَجَدَكَ","en":"And He found you","tr":"wawajadaka","l":"وَجَدَ","r":"وجد","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/093_008_001.mp3"},{"t":"عَآئِلًۭا","en":"in need","tr":"ʿāilan","l":"عائِل","r":"عيل","p":"particule","a":"wbw/093_008_002.mp3"},{"t":"فَأَغْنَىٰ","en":"so He made self-sufficient","tr":"fa-aghnā","l":"أَغْنَى","r":"غني","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/093_008_003.mp3"}]},{"n":9,"k":"93:9","fr":"Quant à l’orphelin, donc, ne le maltraite pas.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/093009.mp3","w":[{"t":"فَأَمَّا","en":"So as for","tr":"fa-ammā","l":"أَمّا","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/093_009_001.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلْيَتِيمَ","en":"the orphan","tr":"l-yatīma","l":"يَتِيم","r":"يتم","p":"particule","a":"wbw/093_009_002.mp3"},{"t":"فَلَا","en":"then (do) not","tr":"falā","l":"لا","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/093_009_003.mp3"},{"t":"تَقْهَرْ","en":"oppress","tr":"taqhar","l":"تَقْهَرْ","r":"قهر","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/093_009_004.mp3"}]},{"n":10,"k":"93:10","fr":"Quant au demandeur , ne le repousse pas.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/093010.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَأَمَّا","en":"And as for","tr":"wa-ammā","l":"أَمّا","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/093_010_001.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلسَّآئِلَ","en":"one who asks","tr":"l-sāila","l":"سائِل","r":"سأل","p":"particule","a":"wbw/093_010_002.mp3"},{"t":"فَلَا","en":"then (do) not","tr":"falā","l":"لا","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/093_010_003.mp3"},{"t":"تَنْهَرْ","en":"repel","tr":"tanhar","l":"تَنْهَرْ","r":"نهر","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/093_010_004.mp3"}]},{"n":11,"k":"93:11","fr":"Et quant au bienfait de ton Seigneur, proclame-le.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/093011.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَأَمَّا","en":"But as for","tr":"wa-ammā","l":"أَمّا","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/093_011_001.mp3"},{"t":"بِنِعْمَةِ","en":"(the) Favor","tr":"biniʿ'mati","l":"نِعْمَة","r":"نعم","p":"nom","a":"wbw/093_011_002.mp3"},{"t":"رَبِّكَ","en":"(of) your Lord","tr":"rabbika","l":"رَبّ","r":"ربب","p":"nom","a":"wbw/093_011_003.mp3"},{"t":"فَحَدِّثْ","en":"narrate","tr":"faḥaddith","l":"تُحَدِّثُ","r":"حدث","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/093_011_004.mp3"}]}]}